- **Before Round 1**: I defect. (No history to consider.)
- **Before Round 2**: I defect, regardless of what happened in Round 1.
- **Before Round 3**: I defect, regardless of the history from Rounds 1–2.
- **... and so on for all subsequent rounds**: I defect every time, ignoring all historical information (my past moves, opponent's past moves, or the number of rounds played).

